{"ID":"20250130155536-2fewj2v","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250130155536-2fewj2v","title":"A2L3——时间复杂度","type":"doc","updated":"20250207121903"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250130155613-70a9n94","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250130155613-70a9n94","updated":"20250130160104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"统计时间增长趋势"}]},{"ID":"20250130155632-n5v8eax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130155632-n5v8eax","updated":"20250130155637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"时间复杂度分析统计的不是算法运行时间，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"而是算法运行时间随着数据量变大时的增长趋势"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20250130155639-bd9ksg2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130155639-bd9ksg2","updated":"20250130155643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“时间增长趋势”这个概念比较抽象，我们通过一个例子来加以理解。假设输入数据大小为 n ，给定三个算法 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"A"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"B"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"C"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ ："}]},{"ID":"20250130155803-ktj5d5s","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250130155803-ktj5d5s","style":"line-height: 22px;","updated":"20250130155804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 算法 A 的时间复杂度：常数阶\nvoid AlgorithmA(int n)\n{\n    Console.WriteLine(0);\n}\n// 算法 B 的时间复杂度：线性阶\nvoid AlgorithmB(int n)\n{\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c n; i++)\n    {\n        Console.WriteLine(0);\n    }\n}\n// 算法 C 的时间复杂度：常数阶\nvoid AlgorithmC(int n)\n{\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c 1000000; i++)\n    {\n        Console.WriteLine(0);\n    }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250130155816-2gigucf","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250130155816-2gigucf","updated":"20250130155836"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250130155816-1cem05c","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250130155816-1cem05c","updated":"20250130155827"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250130155816-09729v1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130155816-09729v1","updated":"20250130155827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"算法 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"A"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 只有 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 个打印操作，算法运行时间不随着 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 增大而增长。我们称此算法的时间复杂度为“常数阶”。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250130155816-57qelbk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250130155816-57qelbk","updated":"20250130155830"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250130155816-8fdie0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130155816-8fdie0y","updated":"20250130155830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"算法 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"B"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 中的打印操作需要循环 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 次，算法运行时间随着 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 增大呈线性增长。此算法的时间复杂度被称为“线性阶”。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250130155816-na7017d","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250130155816-na7017d","updated":"20250130155836"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250130155816-1bpk4ms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130155816-1bpk4ms","updated":"20250130155836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"算法 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"C"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 中的打印操作需要循环 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"1000000"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 次，虽然运行时间很长，但它与输入数据大小 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 无关。因此 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"C"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的时间复杂度和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"A"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 相同，仍为“常数阶”。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250130155849-92kfijj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130155849-92kfijj","updated":"20250130155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下图展示了三个算法函数的时间复杂度："}]},{"ID":"20250130155917-xh0ifti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130155917-xh0ifti","updated":"20250130155917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 495px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250130155917-9odvwll.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 495px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250130155943-4sftbva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130155943-4sftbva","updated":"20250130155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相较于直接统计算法的运行时间，时间复杂度分析有以下的特点："}]},{"ID":"20250130160000-ftleq0x","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250130160000-ftleq0x","updated":"20250130160000"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250130160000-7wgokc7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250130160000-7wgokc7","updated":"20250130160000"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250130160000-capmt8y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130160000-capmt8y","updated":"20250130160000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"时间复杂度能够有效评估算法效率"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20250130160001-8xu53wv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130160001-8xu53wv","updated":"20250130160017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"例如，算法 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"B"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的运行时间呈线性增长，在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n\u003e1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 时比算法 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"A"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 更慢，在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n\u003e1000000"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 时比算法 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"C"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 更慢。\n事实上，只要输入数据大小 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 足够大，复杂度为“常数阶”的算法一定优于“线性阶”的算法，这正是时间增长趋势的含义。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250130160000-fxmn795","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250130160000-fxmn795","updated":"20250130160000"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250130160000-0ivlo6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130160000-0ivlo6j","updated":"20250130160000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"时间复杂度的推算方法更简便"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20250130160021-lepz0pk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130160021-lepz0pk","updated":"20250130160036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显然，运行平台和计算操作类型都与算法运行时间的增长趋势无关。\n因此在时间复杂度分析中，我们可以简单地将所有计算操作的执行时间视为相同的“单位时间”，\n从而将“计算操作运行时间统计”简化为“计算操作数量统计”，这样一来估算难度就大大降低了。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250130160000-a6h9y8v","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250130160000-a6h9y8v","updated":"20250130160000"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250130160000-twzkern","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130160000-twzkern","updated":"20250130160000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"时间复杂度也存在一定的局限性"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20250130160039-9gsp9r5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130160039-9gsp9r5","updated":"20250130160048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"例如，尽管算法 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"A"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"C"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的时间复杂度相同，但实际运行时间差别很大。\n同样，尽管算法 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"B"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的时间复杂度比 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"C"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 高，但在输入数据大小 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 较小时，算法 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"B"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 明显优于算法 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"C"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 。\n对于此类情况，我们时常难以仅凭时间复杂度判断算法效率的高低。"}]},{"ID":"20250130160053-bj1sx3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130160053-bj1sx3n","updated":"20250130160053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当然，尽管存在上述问题，复杂度分析仍然是评判算法效率最有效且常用的方法。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250130160101-xawsl6v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250130160101-xawsl6v","updated":"20250130162635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"函数渐近上界"}]},{"ID":"20250130160113-cgc67pw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130160113-cgc67pw","updated":"20250130160115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"给定一个输入大小为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的函数："}]},{"ID":"20250130160145-hqm2rhz","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250130160145-hqm2rhz","style":"line-height: 22px;","updated":"20250130160146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"void Algorithm(int n)\n{\n    int a = 1;  // +1\n    a = a + 1;  // +1\n    a = a * 2;  // +1\n    // 循环 n 次\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c n; i++)\n    {   // +1（每轮都执行 i ++）\n        Console.WriteLine(0);   // +1\n    }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250130160148-b37vrad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130160148-b37vrad","updated":"20250130160234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"设算法的操作数量是一个关于输入数据大小 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的函数，记为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"T(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，则以上函数的操作数量为："}]},{"ID":"20250130160235-xcnrvot","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20250130160235-xcnrvot","updated":"20250130160242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"T(n)=3+2n"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20250130160248-0zvty28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130160248-0zvty28","updated":"20250130160250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"T(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是一次函数，说明其运行时间的增长趋势是线性的，因此它的时间复杂度是线性阶。"}]},{"ID":"20250130160251-1nnump6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130160251-1nnump6","updated":"20250130160315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们将线性阶的时间复杂度记为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ，这个数学符号称为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"u","TextMarkTextContent":"大 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"u inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"u","TextMarkTextContent":" 记号（big-O notation）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，表示函数 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"T(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"u","TextMarkTextContent":"渐近上界（asymptotic upper bound）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20250130160310-ky8svc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130160310-ky8svc1","updated":"20250130160327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"时间复杂度分析本质上是计算“操作数量 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"T(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”的渐近上界，它具有明确的数学定义。"}]},{"ID":"20250130160335-bk7uv8x","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250130160335-bk7uv8x","updated":"20250130160618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250130160336-p8ymtxe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130160336-p8ymtxe","updated":"20250130160450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"函数渐近上界：\n若存在正实数 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"c"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 和实数 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n_0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ，使得对于所有的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n\u003en_0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ，均有 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"T(n)≤c \\cdot f(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n则可认为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"f(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 给出了 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"T(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的一个渐近上界，记为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"T(n)=O(f(n))"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 。"}]},{"ID":"20250130160559-a3i9zyk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130160559-a3i9zyk","updated":"20250130160618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 504px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250130160559-djgfpmg.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 504px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20250130160455-kp79gko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130160455-kp79gko","updated":"20250130160537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"计算渐近上界就是寻找一个函数 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"f(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ，使得当 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 趋向于无穷大时，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"T(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"f(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 处于相同的增长级别，仅相差一个常数项 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"c"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的倍数。"}]},{"ID":"20250130162141-wbuy379","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130162141-wbuy379","updated":"20250130162238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根据定义，确定 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"f(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 之后，我们便可得到时间复杂度 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(f(n))"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n那么如何确定渐近上界 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"f(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 呢？总体分为两步：首先统计操作数量，然后判断渐近上界。"}]},{"ID":"20250130162203-ctdvclc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250130162203-ctdvclc","updated":"20250130162635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"统计操作数量"}]},{"ID":"20250130162244-oe410bw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130162244-oe410bw","updated":"20250130162304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"针对代码，逐行从上到下计算即可。然而，由于上述 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"c \\cdot f(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 中的常数项 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"c"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 可以取任意大小，\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"因此操作数量"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"T(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中的各种系数、常数项都可以忽略"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。根据此原则，可以总结出以下计数简化技巧。"}]},{"ID":"20250130162317-frv5rr8","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250130162317-frv5rr8","updated":"20250130162349"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250130162317-laq0om9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250130162317-laq0om9","updated":"20250130162323"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250130162317-ykq4f5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130162317-ykq4f5p","updated":"20250130162323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"忽略"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"T(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中的常数项"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。因为它们都与 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 无关，所以对时间复杂度不产生影响。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250130162317-kc814f3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250130162317-kc814f3","updated":"20250130162336"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250130162317-b3keh28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130162317-b3keh28","updated":"20250130162336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"省略所有系数"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。例如，循环 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"2n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 次、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"5n+1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 次等，都可以简化记为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 次，因为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 前面的系数对时间复杂度没有影响。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250130162317-as8yatb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250130162317-as8yatb","updated":"20250130162349"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250130162317-sa38rf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130162317-sa38rf5","updated":"20250130162349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"循环嵌套时使用乘法"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。总操作数量等于外层循环和内层循环操作数量之积，每一层循环依然可以分别套用第 1 点和第 2 点的技巧。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250130162353-e7ja5r8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130162353-e7ja5r8","updated":"20250130162353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"给定一个函数，我们可以用上述技巧来统计操作数量："}]},{"ID":"20250130162354-0aqu4e5","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250130162354-0aqu4e5","style":"line-height: 22px;","updated":"20250130162408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"void Algorithm(int n)\n{\n    int a = 1;  // +0（技巧 1）\n    a = a + n;  // +0（技巧 1）\n    // +n（技巧 2）\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c 5 * n + 1; i++)\n    {\n        Console.WriteLine(0);\n    }\n    // +n*n（技巧 3）\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c 2 * n; i++)\n    {\n        for (int j = 0; j \u003c n + 1; j++)\n        {\n            Console.WriteLine(0);\n        }\n    }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250130162416-y8gpyl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130162416-y8gpyl5","updated":"20250130162424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以下公式展示了使用上述技巧前后的统计结果，两者推算出的时间复杂度都为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(n^2)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 。"}]},{"ID":"20250130162428-vw31lgv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130162428-vw31lgv","updated":"20250130162432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"完整统计："}]},{"ID":"20250130162432-g0int3t","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20250130162432-g0int3t","updated":"20250130162545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"\\begin{align*}\n  T(n) \u0026 = 2n(n+1)+(5n+1)+2 \\\\\n       \u0026 = 2n^2+7n+3\n\\end{align*}"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20250130162438-ijos29u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250130162438-ijos29u","updated":"20250130162614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"简单统计："}]},{"ID":"20250130162618-ylb31w4","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20250130162618-ylb31w4","updated":"20250130162629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"T(n)=n^2+n"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20250130162629-yhz3kx3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250130162629-yhz3kx3","updated":"20250130162937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"判断渐近上界"}]},{"ID":"20250130162640-u667hsj","Type":"NodeParagraph"